28
00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:18.573 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:18.656 --> 00:03:21.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
