43
00:03:54.651 --> 00:03:55.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开…</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:56.819 --> 00:03:57.779 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
