49
00:04:09.332 --> 00:04:10.833 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这什么话？</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那把逆刃刀不也是违法的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:13.878 --> 00:04:15.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
