52
00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:17.507 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:22.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心 这里都是我的朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:26.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是出老千骗钱的那种</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是朋友间随便玩玩小赌怡情</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:29.811 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:29.894 --> 00:04:33.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来都来了 就玩得尽兴点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:33.356 --> 00:04:35.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再闷闷不乐了</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:41.739 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫的死 你从薰小姐那听说了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:41.823 --> 00:04:44.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
