65
00:04:56.921 --> 00:04:59.340 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了！两个一点</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:02.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
