67
00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:05.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们都很久没玩了 多少放点水啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:05.888 --> 00:05:07.598 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>废话少说</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:07.682 --> 00:05:10.893 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好输得只剩兜裆布的心理准备吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:12.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:13.438 --> 00:05:15.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
