72
00:05:15.398 --> 00:05:18.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以为你一个人能逃掉吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:23.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然还想跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:24.032 --> 00:05:25.074 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:26.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（饭馆 集英屋）</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:26.576 --> 00:05:29.912 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 卖糖的宵太怎么没来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:30.705 --> 00:05:34.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他那么爱赌竟然没来</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:36.627 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不知道吗 左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:41.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
