80
00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:44.218 --> 00:05:46.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是病死吗？还是意外？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:48.556 --> 00:05:49.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:05:51.059 --> 00:05:54.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一次抽了大量的鸦片就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:56.189 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“鸦片”</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:05:56.272 --> 00:06:02.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是一种用罂粟果实流出的乳液
干燥凝结制成的毒品</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:05.782 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为会引起严重的戒断症状</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:09.911 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时国家视鸦片为
必须立刻消灭的毒品</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:09.994 --> 00:06:12.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>严厉禁止</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:13.998 --> 00:06:15.500 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个笨蛋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:18.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然沾染了鸦片…</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:18.377 --> 00:06:20.713 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是很奇怪啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:23.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片价格昂贵</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:27.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如此大量的鸦片
普通人应该不太容易获得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:31.766 --> 00:06:33.351 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:37.271 --> 00:06:38.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>救救我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:06:38.648 --> 00:06:39.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:42.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有坏人在追我</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:42.151 --> 00:06:43.945 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>求你了 救救我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:46.614 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠 你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:06:47.323 --> 00:06:48.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你还能往哪跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:51.285 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个接着一个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:51.369 --> 00:06:52.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们到底想干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！少多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:57.750 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把那个女人交出来 不然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:00.461 --> 00:07:02.755 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在心里烦得很</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:04.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话给我小心点</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:08.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…你以为这么做没有后果？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:09.053 --> 00:07:12.265 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们是观柳先生的私兵团成员！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:12.348 --> 00:07:16.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我们作对就是与观柳先生为敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:16.727 --> 00:07:17.728 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>诶？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:17.812 --> 00:07:19.856 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你说话给我小心点 臭杂鱼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:21.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-观柳…
-这可不妙</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:22.024 --> 00:07:24.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是那个武田观柳吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:24.193 --> 00:07:25.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳？</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:25.945 --> 00:07:27.905 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:29.365 --> 00:07:32.910 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>住在城郊的年轻实业家</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:32.994 --> 00:07:34.245 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>表面上是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.956 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他私下里不知道做了什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:37.039 --> 00:07:40.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在过去的几年里迅速积聚了大量财力</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:44.589 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在他在这一带豢养了大量私兵
都是一群形迹可疑的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:45.214 --> 00:07:50.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个镇里的人
从黑道到政治家都不敢跟他发生冲突</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:54.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是观柳的私兵
那你是他的情人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:54.724 --> 00:07:55.725 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:56.517 --> 00:07:59.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我对这些真的一无所知</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.981 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对观柳也是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:02.064 --> 00:08:05.359 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>撒谎可不行啊 高荷惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:09.071 --> 00:08:12.783 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么…那家伙什么时候进来的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:14.202 --> 00:08:17.830 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为只有两个人监视就逃跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:17.914 --> 00:08:22.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实你一直被首领的手下监视着</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:25.379 --> 00:08:29.258 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我的确不是他的情人</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回去告诉观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:31.552 --> 00:08:34.430 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一定会顺利逃出去的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.351 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可爱</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:38.434 --> 00:08:42.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是你还以为真能逃掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:42.939 --> 00:08:45.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你！
-赶紧给我滚！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:47.109 --> 00:08:48.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>知！银次！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:51.155 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>穿击螺旋镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:51.239 --> 00:08:53.032 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才只是见面礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:53.115 --> 00:08:56.994 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来我要打烂你的双腿 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:57.078 --> 00:08:59.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为你逃跑的惩罚</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:06.754 --> 00:09:08.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然用榻榻米来挡！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:08.631 --> 00:09:10.591 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我的镖能穿过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:10.675 --> 00:09:12.176 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不清楚你们有什么过节…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:15.596 --> 00:09:21.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是在下无法眼睁睁
看着别人被杀或受伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:21.978 --> 00:09:23.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少说大话了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:23.312 --> 00:09:25.523 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋 你对我的朋友做了什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:30.152 --> 00:09:31.946 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下真的糟了</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:32.029 --> 00:09:35.575 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳的三个私兵都被打倒了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:37.868 --> 00:09:39.704 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:39.787 --> 00:09:42.582 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其这位剑客简直是无敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:45.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样 男孩们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能不能保护我逃出观柳的魔掌？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:48.629 --> 00:09:51.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会重重酬谢的 好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:51.799 --> 00:09:55.094 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>先别说这个 先跟我们解释清楚</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:59.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-疼！
-我的两个朋友受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:01.183 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我得知道到底怎么回事</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:04.186 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了很疼 别这么用力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:08.733 --> 00:10:10.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:10.192 --> 00:10:12.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在宵太那里也看到过这种小纸包</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:15.239 --> 00:10:19.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的报酬 难道是指这个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:28.169 --> 00:10:30.755 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心他们回来的好慢啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:30.838 --> 00:10:33.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来要么大赢一笔 要么大输一笔</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:33.924 --> 00:10:37.553 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是输的太多 可能就剩兜裆布了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:42.183 --> 00:10:44.018 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要…画面太美我不想看</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:45.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:46.062 --> 00:10:48.230 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！你回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:49.649 --> 00:10:51.817 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好寒酸的房子</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:53.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术道场吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:54.862 --> 00:10:58.074 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 这位是高荷惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:58.157 --> 00:11:00.201 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我们在赌场遇见了一些麻烦…</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:00.284 --> 00:11:05.706 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们赢了 但是对方给不起钱
所以就用她抵债了</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.043 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思 我们暂时得把她留在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:09.126 --> 00:11:12.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>懂了 所以这是满载而归</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:12.129 --> 00:11:14.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:14.215 --> 00:11:17.093 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我们说实话
就得把鸦片的事情告诉她们</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们先暂时保密比较好</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:19.387 --> 00:11:20.471 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:21.806 --> 00:11:24.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说的是真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:24.308 --> 00:11:27.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也不想把小姑娘卷进来吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:30.064 --> 00:11:31.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:34.151 --> 00:11:37.029 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:37.113 --> 00:11:38.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看错你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:40.491 --> 00:11:43.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人口贩卖一样的事你也参与！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:43.911 --> 00:11:46.372 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助就算了 连剑心你都这样！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:46.455 --> 00:11:47.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这话什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:51.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…高荷小姐 是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:51.252 --> 00:11:54.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真抱歉 我会好好批评他们俩的</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:11:55.005 --> 00:11:56.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请你回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:11:56.715 --> 00:11:59.635 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我可一点都不想回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:11:59.718 --> 00:12:02.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢上他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:02.888 --> 00:12:05.266 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一刻也不想跟他分开呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:06.559 --> 00:12:11.313 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个浑身汗味的小姑娘
我好太多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:11.397 --> 00:12:12.440 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是 阿剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:12.523 --> 00:12:15.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！剑心 你有两把刷子嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:16.819 --> 00:12:20.489 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不行！这种事绝对不行！
-哎呀 为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:24.994 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看起来不像是阿剑的恋人</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:25.077 --> 00:12:27.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有立场说不吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:30.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快别逗她了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:30.332 --> 00:12:33.169 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这小姑娘超级单纯的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:36.714 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>出去！都给我出去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:39.633 --> 00:12:42.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-哎呀呀
-真是哭笑不得</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:43.053 --> 00:12:46.974 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都怪你 说些违心的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:47.057 --> 00:12:50.811 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我说不想离开他是真心话</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:50.895 --> 00:12:54.690 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为他实力超强 对人又亲切</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:54.773 --> 00:12:58.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>待在他身边 有人来袭击的话
他一定可以保护我</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:01.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心 是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你当我的护卫正合适</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以倒是可以
至少让我们了解下情况吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:09.079 --> 00:13:10.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同意</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:12.708 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们对你还什么都不了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:13.375 --> 00:13:16.337 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么从观柳那里逃出来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:19.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他又为什么追着你不放？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:21.091 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:21.175 --> 00:13:23.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在哪里怎么得到的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:24.011 --> 00:13:26.222 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>粗鲁之辈才会探听女性的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:26.305 --> 00:13:28.182 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你！
-好了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:28.265 --> 00:13:30.267 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:30.351 --> 00:13:34.396 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一直跟着你 总会查清鸦片的来源</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这玩意害死了我的朋友！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:37.525 --> 00:13:41.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是还在市场上流通 我绝不饶恕</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定全都干掉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:45.908 --> 00:13:46.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:48.035 --> 00:13:50.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这啊 我到处找你</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:50.996 --> 00:13:52.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>修？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:54.875 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是带银次他们去看大夫了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:54.959 --> 00:13:57.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们没什么大事</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:57.962 --> 00:13:59.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有更糟糕的事发生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:00.047 --> 00:14:01.173 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:10.516 --> 00:14:13.561 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是刚才观柳的私兵吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:13.644 --> 00:14:15.020 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好惨</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:15.688 --> 00:14:18.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不放过让他失望的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:21.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是观柳一直以来的作法</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:33.956 --> 00:14:35.708 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-恶见
-是…是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:35.791 --> 00:14:38.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打断你鼻子的那个剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:38.752 --> 00:14:42.840 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是红色头发 脸颊有十字刀疤？</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:42.923 --> 00:14:43.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:45.968 --> 00:14:48.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个混蛋！惠也在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:48.429 --> 00:14:50.806 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好 在这把他干掉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:54.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在公共场合引起骚动会有点麻烦啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:54.643 --> 00:14:56.061 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>收手</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:56.145 --> 00:14:58.147 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:58.856 --> 00:15:01.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管他是什么人 都不是泛泛之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:01.775 --> 00:15:05.362 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见 你一个人不是对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:05.446 --> 00:15:10.826 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然他们在这里 般若你也在吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:11.577 --> 00:15:12.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:13.287 --> 00:15:15.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>查清楚他们的住处了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:17.082 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>查到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:17.166 --> 00:15:21.754 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人感觉敏锐很难跟踪</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:22.463 --> 00:15:24.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-但我还是设法找到了
-很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:25.049 --> 00:15:29.219 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见负责夺回高荷惠 你也去帮忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:30.095 --> 00:15:31.555 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也通知火男</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:32.139 --> 00:15:33.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:33.223 --> 00:15:34.934 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 恶见</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:35.017 --> 00:15:36.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们两个会协助你</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:37.353 --> 00:15:39.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能再忍受任何失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:40.022 --> 00:15:42.650 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>铭记在心 告辞…</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:50.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他们第二次机会
你还真是宽宏大量</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:53.410 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是吗？
-是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:55.663 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:56.538 --> 00:15:58.999 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我骨子里是个商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:59.833 --> 00:16:04.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不赶紧除掉没用的东西我就难受</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:06.006 --> 00:16:11.387 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>安全处理掉 心里就会十分爽快</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:12.346 --> 00:16:13.681 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:16.892 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠带来了不少麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:24.441 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>至关重要的下金蛋的鹅
绝不能让她跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.236 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:27.861 --> 00:16:29.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:32.491 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 那个戴眼镜的男人就是观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:32.574 --> 00:16:35.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 站在他右边的是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:35.953 --> 00:16:38.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你有什么头绪吗？
-没有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:39.164 --> 00:16:42.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-观柳私兵团的团长吗？
-不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.254 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是…首领！</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:45.921 --> 00:16:48.173 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不属于私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:48.257 --> 00:16:51.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是观柳最近雇来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:52.136 --> 00:16:54.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原密探组织御庭番众的首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:55.848 --> 00:16:57.266 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“密探”</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:57.349 --> 00:17:00.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是指活跃在江户时代的秘密间谍</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:05.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天被称作“忍者”</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:05.774 --> 00:17:07.526 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:07.609 --> 00:17:10.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是将军直属的谍报机关</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:10.195 --> 00:17:14.867 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由许多擅长隐秘战斗技能的人组成</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人临近明治维新</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>年仅15岁
就成为了江户城御庭番众的首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:26.879 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是位天才密探 名为四乃森苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:32.342 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他这样的人为什么会给观柳效力？</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:32.426 --> 00:17:33.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:33.802 --> 00:17:34.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:34.928 --> 00:17:38.766 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的敌人是可疑的商人
和危险的御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:39.391 --> 00:17:42.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不能丢下惠小姐不管…</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:44.063 --> 00:17:46.106 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>红发 十字刀疤…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:46.982 --> 00:17:47.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:53.697 --> 00:17:57.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说
观柳的私兵团大概有六十人</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:57.785 --> 00:17:59.828 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对吧？
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:59.912 --> 00:18:01.705 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:03.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大概五、六人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:05.626 --> 00:18:09.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下个问题
惠小姐你在哪里得到的鸦片？</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:15.052 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片的事还是一直闭口不谈吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:15.135 --> 00:18:19.139 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉你这些是帮你们制定作战计划</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:19.223 --> 00:18:21.517 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片的事与此无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其问东问西 不如除掉他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:26.188 --> 00:18:27.523 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:30.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果真的跟御庭番众交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:30.484 --> 00:18:33.278 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕他们也没有胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:33.362 --> 00:18:34.947 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再继续呆在这里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:39.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁着他们忙着战斗 我就逃得远远的</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:39.576 --> 00:18:41.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐 那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:41.829 --> 00:18:44.456 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了别再问我了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.042 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听人家墙角可不好啊 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:47.126 --> 00:18:49.128 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:49.211 --> 00:18:52.005 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回来之后
他们两个人就一直在房里独处！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:52.089 --> 00:18:54.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:54.299 --> 00:18:57.219 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是你想的那样</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:57.302 --> 00:18:58.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是怎么回事啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:59.429 --> 00:19:01.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是他的本性</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:02.641 --> 00:19:08.105 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看见别人有难就不能袖手旁观</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:08.188 --> 00:19:10.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是他的浪客天性</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:11.191 --> 00:19:13.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他作为剑客非常坚强</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:15.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但跟人相处就很心软</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:16.363 --> 00:19:18.240 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是对女人和小孩</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:20.576 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说得也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:20.659 --> 00:19:23.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那左之助你也是一样吗？
-怎么可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:26.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只想帮我朋友报仇而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:26.331 --> 00:19:29.126 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个狐狸女会怎么样我才不关心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:30.252 --> 00:19:33.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿左 没有异常吧？
-没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:34.006 --> 00:19:36.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是观柳一派的组织结构图</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:41.388 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然御庭番众也牵涉其中</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:41.471 --> 00:19:44.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们可能已经查到了这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:44.808 --> 00:19:46.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不能大意</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:47.519 --> 00:19:48.770 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:48.854 --> 00:19:54.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>详情暂时还不能透露
不过这里可能会发生一些骚动</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:58.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
